orbiscreen (0.22.3-1~ubuntunoble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Release 0.22.3 for Ubuntu noble.
  * Eliminate video stuttering and packet bursts by increasing GOP interval to 60 frames (1 keyframe per second).
  * Make virtual mouse an absolute pointer device without REL_X/REL_Y to eliminate cursor snapback.
  * Confine cursor strictly to the virtual secondary screen during touch, drag, and stylus input.
  * Fix stylus tablet tool proximity release to prevent cursor jumping to host display on pen lift.
  * Tune Android input dispatcher loop to 16ms (60 Hz) to avoid uplink Wi-Fi network congestion.

